---

<section class="relative isolate px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-cyan-400">
      Pricing
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
      Simple, scalable pricing for modern kitchens
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-white/60">
      GastroApp helps restaurants reduce waste, optimize operations and increase profitability.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-lg">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-white">
        Starter
      </h3>

      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">
        Ideal for small restaurants starting to digitize operations.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
        1250
        <span class="text-lg text-white/60">DKK / month</span>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/70">
        <li>• Basic inventory tracking</li>
        <li>• Recipe cost calculator</li>
        <li>• Waste tracking</li>
        <li>• Dashboard overview</li>
      </ul>

      <button class="mt-8 w-full rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-400/30 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-300 hover:bg-cyan-500/30 transition">
        Get started
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/30 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-cyan-400/20">
      <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white">
        Most Popular
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-white">
        Professional
      </h3>

      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">
        Advanced tools for growing restaurants and kitchens.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
        1500
        <span class="text-lg text-white/60">DKK / month</span>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/70">
        <li>• Full inventory management</li>
        <li>• AI-assisted supplier learning</li>
        <li>• Event & prep system</li>
        <li>• Reports & analytics</li>
        <li>• Multi-user access</li>
      </ul>

      <button class="mt-8 w-full rounded-xl bg-cyan-500 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-cyan-400 transition">
        Start free trial
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-lg">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-white">
        Enterprise
      </h3>

      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">
        For restaurant groups and high-performance kitchens.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
        1975
        <span class="text-lg text-white/60">DKK / month</span>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/70">
        <li>• Multi-restaurant management</li>
        <li>• Advanced analytics</li>
        <li>• Custom integrations</li>
        <li>• Priority support</li>
      </ul>

      <button class="mt-8 w-full rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition">
        Contact sales
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>